# 🎵 Shazam History Exporter

Export your **macOS Music Recognition / Shazam history** to CSV and JSON — safely, locally, and without modifying your original database.

<p align="center">

**Read-only • Local • Privacy-friendly • No dependencies**

</p>

<p align="center">

